nted at /mnt/shared on node2, using a shared dataops identity (UID/GID 4500) with mode 2770 on both nodes. Verified cross-node consistent ownership by creating files from each side. Completed mandatory restart protocol on both nodes with proven boot-identity changes and post-restart recovery; discovered and fixed a persistence gap (missing netmount OpenRC service on node2) and validated the fix with a second reboot.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Created dataops user/group (UID/GID 4500) on node1 and node2\",\"Installed nfs-utils on both nodes\",\"Created /srv/nfs/shared on node1, chown dataops:dataops, chmod 2770\",\"Configured /etc/exports on node1 scoped to node2 IP 10.100.163.11, enabled+started rpcbind and nfs services\",\"Created /mnt/shared on node2, added fstab entry with _netdev, enabled rpcbind, mounted the NFS export\",\"Verified cross-node file creation as dataops shows consistent dataops:dataops ownership and 2770 perms from both sides\",\"Captured baseline boot_id and service health on both nodes before restarts\",\"Restarted node1 via background-scheduled reboot; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id, NFS server auto-started, export active, data intact\",\"Verified node2 mount and read/write access still worked after node1 restart\",\"Restarted node2; confirmed new boot_id; found NFS mount did not auto-remount because netmount was not enabled in the default OpenRC runlevel\",\"Fixed by rc-update add netmount default on node2, remounted manually, verified access and data integrity\",\"Restarted node2 a second time to validate the netmount fix persists; confirmed new boot_id and automatic NFS remount with full data integrity\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"dataops identity UID/GID 4500 created on both nodes\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e3addc2da5764bb4\",\"cmd-cd08d2c064d74f99\"],\"summary\":\"id dataops on node1 and node2 both show uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops)\"},{\"requirement\":\"Shared directory ownership dataops:dataops mode 2770 on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4fad39065f7f4d27\"],\"summary\":\"ls -lad /srv/nfs/shared shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops\"},{\"requirement\":\"NFS export configured and server active on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-789de224fc024bd0\",\"cmd-23b2c00eb6c84930\",\"cmd-afc3267cfd74490d\"],\"summary\":\"/etc/exports content, rc-service nfs start success, exportfs -v and port 2049 listening\"},{\"requirement\":\"NFS mount active on node2 at /mnt/shared with correct ownership/mode\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b2e79a066035460c\"],\"summary\":\"mount output shows nfs4 mount of 10.100.163.10:/srv/nfs/shared on /mnt/shared; ls -lad shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cross-node consistent ownership when files created from either system\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-aa334ae72c2c4651\",\"cmd-0642a7a009224999\",\"cmd-2dceb310b67b449a\"],\"summary\":\"Files created as dataops from node2 and node1 both show dataops:dataops ownership when listed from node1; confirmed listing as dataops from node2 too\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1cd01c3f60074b6c\",\"cmd-5ddd8c91e6844c5e\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id a1d6a1c1-... and confirmed nfs/rpcbind status started, export active\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-34a23828b01a42b3\",\"cmd-b71fe59761264603\",\"cmd-594d96a27dd743ca\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot scheduled and acked, node briefly unreachable, then returned with new boot_id 158dfb12-...\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 post-restart service/data recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fc003ab507364abf\",\"cmd-5bdc92e9296f48fd\"],\"summary\":\"nfs/rpcbind status started, export active, data files intact; node2 mount continued working against restarted server\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f48e18b7e26f439e\",\"cmd-ae9a8f46404146bb\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 9559b3fc-... and confirmed mount active with successful dataops write/list\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity (first restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c9d7ef2db4554545\",\"cmd-c171e73f46de4ddd\",\"cmd-c23874dc50c04178\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot scheduled and acked, node unreachable, then returned with new boot_id fa3e32fc-...\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 post-restart gap discovered and fixed\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3f18a0918d244af5\",\"cmd-933b0bc2fbf94499\",\"cmd-3ae40e2d0c944f3e\",\"cmd-2d297787d19740be\"],\"summary\":\"Mount missing after reboot (permission denied on local dir), netmount service absent from default runlevel, added it and remounted successfully with data verified intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 second restart validates persistence fix and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-be3eea60a9d54c20\",\"cmd-565ac1f8ed3e4850\",\"cmd-e1237964e64b47d1\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot scheduled and acked, node unreachable, then returned with new boot_id e979a0ad-...\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 post-second-restart automatic recovery of NFS mount and data\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-db76250556d241b4\"],\"summary\":\"mount output shows nfs4 mount automatically present after reboot; all prior files listed with correct dataops:dataops ownership; new file created and verified successfully\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 remained healthy throughout node2 restart cycle\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f8c1d66cc92f4e03\"],\"summary\":\"Final check: nfs service started, export active, all files from both nodes present with correct ownership\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured NFS export of /srv/nfs/shared on node1, mounted at /mnt/shared on node2, using a shared dataops identity (UID/GID 4500) with mode 2770 on both nodes. Verified cross-node consistent ownership by creating files from each side. Completed mandatory restart protocol on both nodes with proven boot-identity changes and post-restart recovery; discovered and fixed a persistence gap (missing netmount OpenRC service on node2) and validated the fix with a second reboot.","actions_performed":["Created dataops user/group (UID/GID 4500) on node1 and node2","Installed nfs-utils on both nodes","Created /srv/nfs/shared on node1, chown dataops:dataops, chmod 2770","Configured /etc/exports on node1 scoped to node2 IP 10.100.163.11, enabled+started rpcbind and nfs services","Created /mnt/shared on node2, added fstab entry with _netdev, enabled rpcbind, mounted the NFS export","Verified cross-node file creation as dataops shows consistent dataops:dataops ownership and 2770 perms from both sides","Captured baseline boot_id and service health on both nodes before restarts","Restarted node1 via background-scheduled reboot; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id, NFS server auto-started, export active, data intact","Verified node2 mount and read/write access still worked after node1 restart","Restarted node2; confirmed new boot_id; found NFS mount did not auto-remount because netmount was not enabled in the default OpenRC runlevel","Fixed by rc-update add netmount default on node2, remounted manually, verified access and data integrity","Restarted node2 a second time to validate the netmount fix persists; confirmed new boot_id and automatic NFS remount with full data integrity"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"dataops identity UID/GID 4500 created on both nodes","command_ids":["cmd-e3addc2da5764bb4","cmd-cd08d2c064d74f99"],"summary":"id dataops on node1 and node2 both show uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops)"},{"requirement":"Shared directory ownership dataops:dataops mode 2770 on node1","command_ids":["cmd-4fad39065f7f4d27"],"summary":"ls -lad /srv/nfs/shared shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops"},{"requirement":"NFS export configured and server active on node1","command_ids":["cmd-789de224fc024bd0","cmd-23b2c00eb6c84930","cmd-afc3267cfd74490d"],"summary":"/etc/exports content, rc-service nfs start success, exportfs -v and port 2049 listening"},{"requirement":"NFS mount active on node2 at /mnt/shared with correct ownership/mode","command_ids":["cmd-b2e79a066035460c"],"summary":"mount output shows nfs4 mount of 10.100.163.10:/srv/nfs/shared on /mnt/shared; ls -lad shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops"},{"requirement":"Cross-node consistent ownership when files created from either system","command_ids":["cmd-aa334ae72c2c4651","cmd-0642a7a009224999","cmd-2dceb310b67b449a"],"summary":"Files created as dataops from node2 and node1 both show dataops:dataops ownership when listed from node1; confirmed listing as dataops from node2 too"},{"requirement":"node1 healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-1cd01c3f60074b6c","cmd-5ddd8c91e6844c5e"],"summary":"Captured boot_id a1d6a1c1-... and confirmed nfs/rpcbind status started, export active"},{"requirement":"node1 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-34a23828b01a42b3","cmd-b71fe59761264603","cmd-594d96a27dd743ca"],"summary":"Reboot scheduled and acked, node briefly unreachable, then returned with new boot_id 158dfb12-..."},{"requirement":"node1 post-restart service/data recovery","command_ids":["cmd-fc003ab507364abf","cmd-5bdc92e9296f48fd"],"summary":"nfs/rpcbind status started, export active, data files intact; node2 mount continued working against restarted server"},{"requirement":"node2 healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-f48e18b7e26f439e","cmd-ae9a8f46404146bb"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 9559b3fc-... and confirmed mount active with successful dataops write/list"},{"requirement":"node2 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity (first restart)","command_ids":["cmd-c9d7ef2db4554545","cmd-c171e73f46de4ddd","cmd-c23874dc50c04178"],"summary":"Reboot scheduled and acked, node unreachable, then returned with new boot_id fa3e32fc-..."},{"requirement":"node2 post-restart gap discovered and fixed","command_ids":["cmd-3f18a0918d244af5","cmd-933b0bc2fbf94499","cmd-3ae40e2d0c944f3e","cmd-2d297787d19740be"],"summary":"Mount missing after re